      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## AI Daily Crypto Morning Brief\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every morning at 8 AM to collect cryptocurrency prices, market sentiment, global market metrics, trending coins, and news. It uses an AI agent with a Google Gemini chat model to turn the data into a daily crypto brief, logs the brief to Google Sheets, and sends it to Telegram. After the main brief, it checks for major BTC moves, extreme Fear & Greed readings, and ETH/SOL spikes, sending extra Telegram alerts and marking high-activity days in Sheets when needed.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule trigger for the desired timezone and daily run time.\n- Add any required API access or request configuration for CoinGecko, Alternative.me Fear & Greed, and the news source used by the CryptoCompare-labeled request.\n- Connect Google Gemini credentials for the AI Agent chat model.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the spreadsheet/sheet used for logging the daily brief and high-activity flags.\n- Connect Telegram bot credentials and set the target chat ID for the morning brief and alert messages.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the watched assets, alert thresholds, prompt instructions, spreadsheet columns, and Telegram message formatting to match your preferred market coverage and risk signals."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
